  "verseCount": 55,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yakobo yaawulira batabane ba Labani nga bakoba bati: “Yakobo atwaire ebyayo byonabyona ebyali ebya iseife. Era mu ebyo mw'afuniire obukombe obwo bwonabwona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Yakobo yaabona nga Labani takaamusangaalira nga bweyakolanga eira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Yakobo ati: “Irayo mu nsi ya badhaadha bo, era y'aboluganda lwo. Ndidha kubanga n'iwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale, Yakobo yaayesa Rakeli ni Leeya baje bamwagaane mu kyayiro aghaali ebyayo bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabakoba ati: “Mboine nga iseimwe takansagaalira nga bweyakolanga eira. Aye Katonda wa lata wange abairenga ninze buliidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhi bukalamu nga nkoleire iseimwe n'amaani gange goonagoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye iseimwe yanguyaguya, yaakyusakyusa empeera yange emikuzi ikumi, aye Katonda yaaloba kumuganha kunkolaku kabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseimwe oyo bweyakobanga ati, ‘Ensolo edh'obudholodhondho n'edhinaaba empeera yo,’ ng'olwo ensolo dhoonadhoona dhizaala dha budholodhondho. Ate bweyakobanga ati, ‘Edh'emyalaala n'edhinaaba empeera yo,’ ng'olwo dhoonadhoona dhizaala dha myalaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nsambo ng'oti n'eyo, Katonda yaatoola ku iseimwe ebyayo, yaabimpa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu biseera ensolo mwe dhighakira, okuja okulinga nti nga mbona mu kirooto embuzi enume edhaali dhiri kuniina ku nkazi; dhaali edh'emyalaala, edh'obudholodhondho n'edha bitanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Katonda yandheta ati, ‘Yakobo!’ Naavugira nti, ‘Ndi ghano!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yankoba ati, ‘Bona, embuzi dhoonadhoona enume edhiri kuniina ku nkazi, dha myalaala, n'edh'obudholodhondho, era n'edha bitanga; kuba mboine byonabyona Labani by'ali kukukola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninze Katonda eyakubonekera e Betheli, ye wafukira omuzigo ku ibaale ni liba ekiidhukizo. Era ninze Katonda oyo ye wagha obweyamo ku olwo. Mpegaano situka oireyo mu nsi ye wazaalibwamu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeli ni Leeya baamwiramu bati: “Memale ife tukaali n'omugabo oba obusika mu ndhu ya iseife? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpegaano atutwala ng'abagwira. Yamala okututunda, era mpegaano aliire n'ebintu ebyatugula, yaabimalagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukombe bwonabwona Katonda bw'atoire ku iseife, mpegaano bwaife n'abaana baife. Kale, iwe mpegaano kola kyonakyona Katonda ky'akukobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yakobo yaasitula olugendo, yaatyamya abaana be ni bakazi be ku ngamiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatwala ebyayo bye byonabyona, era n'ebintu byonabyona bye yali afunie mu Paddanarama, yaaja mu nsi ey'e Kanaani ye lata we Isaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yali ng'ajiire okusala ku ntaama obuviiri, Rakeli yaiba emisambwa gya ise egy'omu maka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yeiba bweibe ku Labani Omuaramea; tiyamukoberaku ng'aja kumulumukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalumuka n'ebibye byonabyona, yaasomoka omwiga Eufurate, yaayolekera ensi ey'ensozi, Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ghabiseegho enaku isatu, baakobera Labani bati Yakobo yalumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yaaja n'ab'ekika kye, yaabingirira Yakobo, olugendo lwa nnaku musanvu, yaamutuukaku mu nsi ey'ensozi, Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Katonda yaidhira Labani Omuaramea obwire mu kirooto, yaamukoba ati: “Weegendereze olobe kubaaku kintu kyonakyona ky'okoba Yakobo, kya kumutiisatiisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani bweyatuuka ku Yakobo, Yakobo yali ng'asimbye weema ye mu nsi ey'ensozi. Labani yeena yaasimba eyo weema ye n'ab'ekika kye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yaakoba Yakobo ati: “Lwaki waneibaku n'otwala baghala bange ng'oti n'abanhage mu lutalo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwaki waanumukaku mu ngiso, ni weiba nga tonkobeire. Nandibaire nkusiibwire nga tuli kusagamba era nga tuli kwembera ku bugoma ni ku ndingidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiwanganha na kwevumba ku baidhukulu bange ni baghala bange nga mbasiibula. Ekyo wakola kya busiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaire nsobola okukukolaku akabi. Aye Katonda wa lata wo yankobye obwire ati, ‘Weegendereze, olobe kubaaku kintu kyonakyona ky'okoba Yakobo, kya kumutiisatiisa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidhi nti wayendanga inho okuja, kuba ng'olumirwa inho endhu ya lata wo. Aye lwaki waiba emisambwa gyange egy'omu maka?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yairamu Labani ati: “Nakulumukaku kuba natya nga ndhuuba nti wandintoireku baghala bo bya ntaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omuntu yeenayeena y'onaayagaana n'emisambwa gyo, aidha kwitibwa. Mpegaano ni, nga n'aboluganda lwaife bali kubona, yawulamu buli kikyo kye ndi nakyo okitwale.” Yakobo yali taidhi nga Rakeli yaiba emisambwa gya Labani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Labani yaingira, yaayagaaza mu weema ya Yakobo, ni mu weema ya Leeya, ni mu weema ey'abairu abakazi bombi, aye yaaloba kuzuula misambwa gye. Yaava mu weema ya Leeya, yaingira mu ya Rakeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeli yali atoire emisambwa egy'omu maka egyo, yaagita mu nsawo ey'oku kintu ekityamibwaku ku ngamiya, yaagityamaku. Labani yaayagaaza mu weema mwonamwona, aye yaaloba kugizuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeli yaakoba ise ati: “Isebo, otansungughalira olw'obutasobola kwemerera mu maiso go, kuba ndi mulwaire.” Labani yaayagaaza aye yaaloba kuzuula misambwa gye egy'omu maka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yasungughala, yaanenia Labani. Yaamukoba ati: “Nkoze kibi ki, era ndhiziiza musango ki, memale omingirire otyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waire ng'oyagaaziiza mu bintu byange byonabyona, kiki ku by'omu ndhu yo ky'ozwiremu? Kite ghano mu maiso g'aboluganda lwange n'iwe, beene batusaliregho omutuufu ku twembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu myaka egyo amakumi abiri gye mbaire n'iwe, entaama dho n'embuzi dho enkazi tidhisondholangaku, era enume edhiba mu byayo byo, ghazira waire ndala ye ndyangaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaama eyaitibwanga ensolo tyagikuleeteranga, aye nze neefiirizanga naakwirizaagho enamu ku dhange. Era eyo eyaibibwanga waire omusana oba obwire, wandagiranga okugikwirizaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale omusana gwampwerangaku, ate obwire empewo yanfuuwanga, era endoolo dhambulanga mu maiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu myaka egyo amakumi abiri gye mbaire mu maka go, nakukolera emyaka ikumi n'ena okufuna baghala bo bombi. Era naakukolera mu byayo byo emyaka mukaaga, aye iwe waakyusakyusa empeera yange emikuzi ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguli Katonda wa lata wange, Katonda wa Aburahamu era Katonda wa Isaaka tiyali ku luuyi lwange, wandibaire mpegaano ng'ominze nga nzira kantu. Aye Katonda yabona nga bwe nadaazibwadaazibwanga era nga bwe nakolanga einho, kye yaviire n'akunenia obwire buno obwabise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yairamu Yakobo ati: “Bano baghala bange, n'abaana baibwe bange, era n'ebyayo bino byange, era n'ebyo byonabyona by'oli kubona ghano byange. Aye olwaleero nsobola kukolera ki baghala bange bano, oba abaana be baazaala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni mpegaano, ka tukole endagaano nze n'iwe, ebenga obukakafu ghagati wo ninze.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yakobo yaatoola eibaale, yalisimbagho libe ekiidhukizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaakoba aboluganda lwe ati: “Musoloze amabaale.” Baasoloza amabaale baagatuuma entuumo, baaliira agho kumpi n'entuumo eyo ekiiwulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yaagituuma eriina Yegari Sahadutha, aye Yakobo yaagituuma Galeedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yaakoba ati: “Entuumo eno, n'obukakafu ghagati wo ninze olwaleero.” Kyeyava n'etuumibwa eriina Galeedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era n'etuumibwa Mizipa, kuba Labani yakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda alamulenga ghagati wo ninze bwe tuliba nga titukaabonagana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'onaadaazadaazanga baghala bange oba n'obayiza abakazi abandi, waire tighaliba muntu wundi ali n'ife, idhukira nga Katonda n'omudhulizi ghagati wo ninze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani yaakoba Yakobo ati: “Bona entuumo eno ey'amabaale, era n'eibaale lino erisimbiibwagho ghagati wo ninze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entuumo eno era n'eibaale lino, binaabanga ekikakasa nti: nze tirituuma ntuumo eno kwidha kukulumba, era weena nga tolituuma ntuumo eno n'eibaale lino, kwidha kuunumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wa Aburahamu era Katonda wa Nahori, atusalirenga omusango nze n'iwe.” Yakobo yaalayira mu liina lya Katonda wa Isaaka ise, ati aidha kukuumanga endagaano eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaagheera eyo omusengo ku lusozi olwo, yaayeta aboluganda lwe okulya emere. Baalya era baasula eyo ku lusozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe bwakya ku nkyo, Labani yaazuuka, yaagwa baidhukulu be ni baghala be mu kifuba, yabasabira enkabi. Yaasitula okwirayo ewuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
